  logId: log_ranger_apex_mutation
  speakerName: Korucu Berk
  transcriptText: "Kuzeybat\u0131 orman\u0131ndaki g\xF6l kenar\u0131nda devasa bir
    k\xFCtle g\xF6rd\xFCm. Normal bir enfekte de\u011Fil, biyok\xFCtleleri birle\u015Ftiren
    bir tepe avc\u0131. \xC7\u0131\u011Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131 kilometrelerce \xF6teden
    duyuluyor. S\u0131\u011F\u0131na\u011F\u0131n kap\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 g\xFC\xE7lendirin,
    o \u015Fey \u015Fehre do\u011Fru iniyor."
