  transcriptText: "Karantina Protokol\xFC 9. g\xFCn. \u015Eehir d\u0131\u015F ba\u011Flant\u0131lar\u0131
    kesildi. Vakalar bekledi\u011Fimizden h\u0131zl\u0131 mutasyona u\u011Fruyor.
    Vir\xFCs s\u0131radan bir kuduz su\u015Fu de\u011Fil, yapay bir retrovir\xFCs
    ta\u015F\u0131y\u0131c\u0131s\u0131. S\u0131\u011F\u0131naktaki laboratuvar\u0131m\u0131
    korumam gerek."
