  logId: log_metro_quarantine
  speakerName: Dr. Aras
  transcriptText: "Metro t\xFCnellerine s\u0131\u011F\u0131nan y\xFCzlerce sivil
    vard\u0131... ama havaland\u0131rma \u015Faftlar\u0131ndan s\u0131zd\u0131lar.
